WEBVTT

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.550
Inn?

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.980
Hey, you're up.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:14.890
Atla...

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.330
Frau died again!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:58.300
Carrot and Millia

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.170
You're not dead. 
This is the worldly realm.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.760
I've been watching since I sent you here.

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.240
After the battle, you lost consciousness,

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.980
and your friends brought you here to rest.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.480
The two girls went into the city

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.510
to buy carrots for you.

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:19.480
The swordsman has been guarding your door 
so no one gets in.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.440
I came in the window, of course.

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.530
They're good companions, though.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:30.200
They were surprised, but not hostile, 
to see you in that form.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.280
Good to hear.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.420
But you won't get far in the worldly realm 
if you look like that.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.980
I'll withdraw the power you employed.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.790
Please!

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.860
Close your eyes.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.120
Grateful to Atla.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.840
No problem. 
We're former companions.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.560
Not "former." Still companions.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.790
Don't say that.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.740
You'll make me miss you more.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.700
Frau? You up?

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.490
I thought I heard voices.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.090
Just my imagination?

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.580
Well, look at you.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.220
You're back to normal.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.220
Carrots! Carrots! Carrots!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:30.350
Sally... shouldn't we be looking for medicine, 
rather than carrots?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.150
You'd think so,

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.480
but when Frau fought 
that walrus ogre earlier...

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:39.850
Just eating carrots made them all better!

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.360
Walrus ogre...

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.510
Sally.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:50.380
There's something 
I've been wanting to ask you.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.870
Are you the one who killed Sett?

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:00.880
Yes.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.510
I'm the one who killed him.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.660
But I won't apologize for it!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.980
Same as with that tree ogre,

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.590
I used my power because I had to!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.880
Okay, ladies!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.210
If you wanna fight, do it somewhere else!

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:25.280
You're gettin' in the way of my business.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.110
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:27.930
Pathetic.

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:30.280
<i>He's the one...</i>

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.540
Hey, you're that girl from yesterday!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.980
Oh? You know each other?

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.050
Hardly!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.040
Not with that demihuman today, eh?

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:43.620
I know they're a rare sight and all,

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.270
but you shouldn't be fraternizing 
with demihumans.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.690
They might look human enough,

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.800
but inside, they're nothing but beasts.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.810
They're worse than cattle, 
since you can't even eat 'em.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:01.390
Anyway, keep away 
from those damned demihumans—

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:08.050
That person you're insulting 
is my companion.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.320
I won't let you demean them.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:24.350
He's...

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.340
Excuse me!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:30.020
An angel, eh?

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.140
You're dead, aren't you?

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.620
You shouldn't be here.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.490
You need to pass on.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:36.840
I hope to.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:39.210
But give me a bit longer, 
if you please.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.420
What? A demihuman companion?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.780
You nuts or something?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.410
Why are you lookin' at me like that?

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.480
Creepy little thing... 
Get out of my sight!

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.340
Let's go.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:09.550
Right.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:18.180
I used my power because I had to!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:22.500
<i>With Juki, she fought to save Hatsuki 
before he killed her.</i>

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.970
<i>And she fought now for Frau.</i>

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:29.180
<i>I see. 
So that's the kind of human Sally is.</i>

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:31.650
What's got you all smiley?

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.830
Oh, nothing.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.560
That really made my day... is all.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.430
Don't say that.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.710
I'm actually regretting it.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.330
Don't be silly!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.750
You should have killed him 
while you were at it!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.320
I certainly would have—

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.990
Wh-What?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.080
I'm an ogre, after all.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.500
It shouldn't be a surprise 
that I'd kill a human!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.220
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:03.900
Do you really think people like that 
can reach a compromise with Frau,

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.220
if you just punch them out?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.870
Well, I said I regretted it.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.370
I shouldn't have done it.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.730
But, well...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:17.390
Punching him out 
<i>did</i> let me see your smile.

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:19.180
So I might not regret it 
that much after all.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:24.370
I mean... Your anger and your joy 
were both on Frau's behalf, right?

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.130
You might act all, 
"I'm an ogre. I'm so evil,"

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:31.830
but you really do see 
Frau as a companion.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.110
Now, let's find those carrots!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:40.020
<i>My heart is still that of an ogre.</i>

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.040
<i>But right now,</i>

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:48.080
<i>I'm neither ogre nor human.</i>

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.150
<i>I'm just me.</i>

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.760
<i>I'm just Carrot.</i>

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.210
<i>And maybe that's okay for now.</i>

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:57.910
<i>Maybe that's a compromise, too.</i>

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.830
Did you say something?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.470
Nothing at all.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:08.170
Oh, is that your body they're burning?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:12.930
Yes, it seems a few 
of my attacks were witnessed.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:18.540
Do you enjoy watching yourself burn?

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:21.440
I lived three hundred years with that body.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.930
Watching it go is the least I can do.

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:28.690
I hope you're reborn 
as anything but an ogre.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.330
As a human, you mean?

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:35.380
Seeing their frenzy over my burning corpse,

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:37.660
it's hard to believe 
it would be an improvement.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.230
Don't base your opinion of them 
on that alone.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.400
You have a point.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.390
A very good one.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.400
By the way, angel...

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.600
Atla.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.270
It may not matter now,

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:53.590
but I was killed by a harefolk—

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.100
Rather, by something assuming a harefolk's form.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.850
That wasn't a harefolk.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.030
It wasn't even a natural creature.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.460
It was closer to an ogre than anything.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:13.020
What is something like that 
doing in the world of humans?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.490
It's what they wanted for themself.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.820
You know that thing?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.230
Then tell me. What is—

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.450
It seems the time has come.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.750
Nothing else keeping me here...

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.810
Take me away, angel.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:38.320
I told you. It's "Atla."

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.630
Now close your eyes and hold still.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:42.880
Certainly.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.180
<i>Don't end up like me, Carrot.</i>

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.030
Carrot?

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.780
Oh, nothing.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:08.300
But you're back to normal, I see.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:14.050
Do you mind if I ask 
what you really are, Frau?

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.480
You don't have to say 
if you don't want to.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:24.060
You're still our companion, aren't you?

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:25.980
Companion.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.080
I understand.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.690
That's all I needed.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:33.680
I am very curious, 
but I'm choosing to compromise.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.620
Has Carrot changed a bit?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.650
It's a little galling 
to hear her steal my lines, though.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.130
Hey, Frau!

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:43.730
Are you feeling better?

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.070
Are you ready to get back on the road?

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:48.100
Hey now! That's too reckless!

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.050
Frau only just woke up.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.900
Let them have a day of rest.

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.320
That seems unlikely to happen.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:55.720
How come?

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.840
Sally struck one of the villagers 
in public earlier.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:05.090
The garrison will likely be investigating.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.530
What the heck were you thinking?!

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:08.940
What do you want from me?

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.720
The guy was being a total creep!

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:14.350
It wasn't my fault. Much.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.480
I see.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.660
Now come to jail to clear your head!

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.290
No! I hate jail!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.850
Why did Sally hit a man?

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.260
Because...

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:33.140
Carrot! Help me chew her out!

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:36.190
That man deserved what he got!

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.610
Right, Frau?

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:38.750
Deserved.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.380
You, too, Frau?!

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.490
Why do you always choose these back routes?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.850
It's the shortest way to the next town.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.640
We could just follow the main road, 
you know...

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.820
We might not have a bandit 
tracking us, then.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.680
You noticed?

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:59.410
One set of footsteps...

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.660
I'll finish it...

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:02.590
quickly!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.580
A nun?

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.620
Excuse me, girl.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.910
Y-Your dog talks...

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.310
What are you so afraid of?

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.810
Nobody's going to eat you.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:38.350
You might boil <i>me</i> in that pot 
if I'm not careful.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.940
If you want to eat, 
you'd better do it fast.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:48.150
I suppose I'll eat.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.150
I'm terribly sorry,

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:54.440
but I don't have anything to pay you with.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.780
Don't worry about it.

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:59.080
I really scared you back there.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.450
Accept this as my apology.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.350
It's delicious.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:09.150
What's a nun like you 
doing alone in the mountains?

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.900
Do I appear to be a nun?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:13.970
Yes?

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.590
I seem to have some kind of amnesia.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:20.430
I don't remember anything except my name.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.850
Do you mind if I ask your name?

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:28.300
Not at all! I'm Millia!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.470
Mikoto.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.810
I'm known as Kibitsu Mikoto.

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.550
I knew it.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.530
Are you going to kill her?

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.910
Of course I am.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.780
She's an ogre.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.670
An ogre? Look closer!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:10.790
That's nothing but a girl 
who's lost her memory.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:16.420
Dog. Why do you protect her?

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.790
Are you on the ogres' side?

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:25.620
Don't you point your blade at me, child!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:34.020
I'm not on the ogres' side 
any more than I'm on yours!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:37.520
I'm on Kibitsu Mikoto's side!

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:43.060
If you're going to take that name, 
don't do anything to disgrace it!

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.760
We'll arrive at the next town tomorrow.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:01.870
I'll let her stay with me till then.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.870
After that, her fate is none of my concern.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.040
Good.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:11.070
And... 
I shouldn't have pointed my sword at you.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.310
I'm sorry.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.180
Think nothing of it.

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:30.760
Were you hurt?

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:36.010
But fighting while protecting someone 
is exhausting.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:38.170
I'm so sorry for the trouble!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:40.080
Any thoughts, Dog?

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.660
We've barely made a dent.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:48.080
I'd say there are ten 
or twenty still lurking around.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.730
There are still so many monsters 
around here?

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:54.800
They look like monsters, but they aren't.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.960
They're ogres.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.750
"Ogres"?

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:00.350
Yes. A breed of low ogre.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.440
Beast-type ogres.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.570
The horns are the proof.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:09.610
There are many ogres 
that take curious forms.

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:12.070
Some even dwell in masks, or in trees.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.990
Ogres... in trees?

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.600
What's wrong?

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.770
Oh, I just...

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:24.020
I felt like I was remembering something.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.250
The city should be just ahead.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:34.640
The city...

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.760
What will I do in the city?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.260
You might want to stop by the church.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.560
I see.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.780
I am a nun, after all.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:46.730
Visiting a church might trigger a memory.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.280
I see.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.660
So you're clinging to travelers to survive.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.850
How very pathetic.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.480
Who are you?

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:00.330
A mid ogre. I have no name.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:01.940
Hatsuki.

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.800
I am under orders to capture you.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.600
"Hatsuki"?

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:08.880
Do you mean... me?

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.600
Your pardon, Sir Ogre.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.630
What is it, human?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.850
The nun here is currently suffering 
from amnesia.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.170
Please be gentle with her.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:23.950
Amnesia?!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:27.090
Defeated by a human, abandoning Lord Juki,

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.820
and even fleeing from yourself?!

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.120
I was ordered to capture you,

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.190
but I see no reason to let you live!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.810
"Juki"?

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:40.060
If you're going to humiliate yourself, 
you'd be better off dead!

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.450
Pitiful creature!

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:44.210
This is my order.

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.570
Human?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.090
I remember.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.160
That's right.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:53.710
I'm Hatsuki.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.320
I'm an ogre!

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:01.350
A nameless cretin like you 
dares challenge me?!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.450
I meant to slice you in half,

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.100
but you're still rather tough.

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.120
Not bad... for a pathetic mid ogre.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.340
Spirit and horn both broken,

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.620
yet you still talk down to me?

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.110
<i>Madame</i> Hatsuki.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:23.610
<i>Damn. Mocked by a nameless mid ogre...</i>

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.000
<i>Damnation!</i>

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.610
Do you mind?

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:36.370
Sorry. This is just really boring to me.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.470
I was happy to leave a helpless nun be,

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:43.800
but now that your memory's back, 
you're an ogre, too.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:48.580
By all means, kill each other.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:51.520
Then I'll kill the survivor.

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:54.020
A curious human...

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:00.690
Any last words?

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:04.020
<i>I can still use my hair.</i>

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:07.910
<i>But even if I slay this mid ogre,</i>

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:11.300
<i>he'll do the same to me.</i>

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:16.040
<i>Will I die... 
this time, for real?</i>

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:27.560
Hey! Kibitsu Mikoto!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:45.380
Look! I don't have my horn anymore.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.510
I can't move a single lock of hair.

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:50.150
I'm not an ogre now.

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:51.950
I'm just a helpless nun!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.400
Now take responsibility 
and help me, dammit!

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.460
<i>Crap.</i>

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.550
<i>I've lost too much blood.</i>

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.840
<i>I'm about to pass out.</i>

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.210
<i>What a blunder.</i>

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:11.520
<i>I'll probably die 
before they're done fighting.</i>

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.100
<i>I don't want to die.</i>

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:17.120
<i>I've remembered everything.</i>

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:19.520
<i>So even without my horn...</i>

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:21.610
<i>Even if I must depend on humans...</i>

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.250
<i>I want to keep living.</i>

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:27.820
<i>I want to survive to meet that human again.</i>

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:33.130
<i>The one who broke my spirit... 
And her eye...</i>

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:41.020
<i>I want to gaze into that eye of hers 
and tell her off.</i>

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.500
<i>So... please, Mikoto...</i>

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.550
Save me!

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.510
I already did.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:51.740
Where am I?

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.240
A village in town.

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:55.480
In town?

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.520
What happened? Did you kill him?

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.870
No.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.140
Oh, I was raring to do it,

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:06.210
but since I was in a hurry 
to stop your blood loss,

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.790
I let him go.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:13.290
He realized immediately 
how outclassed he was.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.050
Surprising smart, for a nameless mid ogre.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:18.160
Mikoto.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.910
Thanks for saving me!

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.420
You're welcome.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.670
What do you plan to—

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.070
I've got nothing better going on!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:33.860
So I figured I'd stick with you.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:36.450
That's extremely presumptuous of you.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.260
But if you wish.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:42.520
I wouldn't want you to die on the road 
right after I saved you.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.440
All right, you're on!

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:47.750
I'm Millia, in case you forgot!

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:49.710
Nice to meet ya, best bud!

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.670
Please don't call me "best bud."

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:55.350
Don't be so shy!

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:56.640
This could be fun!

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.970
A relaxing journey, just us girls!

00:22:00.940 --> 00:22:05.210
I should let you know. 
I'm a man.

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:08.710
Don't be silly!

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:11.120
With that face and that voice...

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:50.060
Species and Belonging

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.400
Next time: "Species and Belonging."
